Hanumān finds vast half-yōjana Rāvaṇa mansion seeking Sītā --- Hanumān climbs divine Puṣpaka seized from Kubēra --- Hanumān follows wine-food scent to beloved jewelled hall --- Hanumān mistakes hall for heaven and lamps for gazers --- Hanumān sees thousand wine-sleeping women tangled like garland --- Hanumān sees moonlike Rāvaṇa among women like moon among stars --- Hanumān learns no wife was forced except Jānakī --- Hanumān concludes Sītā surpasses all and condemns cruel lust
